# Celestic Town (the original's CITY04 role, which it shares with Eterna City; here a theme of its own): the oldest town
# of Sinnoh round its shrine and ancient carving, and the elder who keeps the legends of time and space. A slow D-Dorian
# sarabande, solemn but kind: the oboe over a lute and a drone, a choir chanting in bare fifths that warms into full chords,
# a shrine bell at each phrase's end; by night the ocarina, a harp and a pad. Original composition for this game.
title Celestic Town
tempo 66
meter 3/4
reverb 0.42
nighttempo 0.94

